<title>USA: Brooklyn Union names KeySpan leader.</title>
<headline>Brooklyn Union names KeySpan leader.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brooklyn Union Gas Co said Tuesday Gene Martin has been named president of KeySpan Energy Management Inc, a Brooklyn Union marketing subsidiary serving the Northeast.</p>
<p>Martin had been president of UtiliCorp United Inc's Entrust Energy Solution unit.</p>
<p>He is the first president at KeySpan Energy Management, which provides customers with a variety of services, including design, financing, turnkey installation, operation, maintenance, upgrading and rehabilitation of power, steam and cooling equipment.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.))</p>
